conditionType.description:
The kind of threshold. All tiers in the same rule MUST send the same value. Valid values depend on the promotion class -
 product: product_quantity, product_amount; order: order_total, product_quantity, product_combination;
 shipping: shipment_total, product_quantity, product_combination.

operator.description:
The comparison operator, as a lower_snake_case token. The valid set depends on the condition type:
 category: is_equal, is_exactly, is_direct_child_of, is_child_of, is_direct_parent_of, is_parent_of, is_sibling_of;
 brand: exists, does_not_exist, is_equal, is_not_equal, starts_with, ends_with, contains, does_not_contain;
 product_id: is_equal, is_not_equal, starts_with, ends_with, contains, does_not_contain;
 price: less_than, greater_than, ends_with;
 inventory: less_than, greater_than;
 attribute: less_than, greater_than, equals, is_not_equal, exists, does_not_exist, starts_with, ends_with, contains, does_not_contain;
 product_set: is_equal, exists;
 price_book: storefront_price_in_recursive, storefront_price_in, price_in;
 option: is_equal, exists, does_not_exist.
